        "content": "# P2 Confirmed a Russian Geran-2 drone by Moldovas Defense Ministry and by Romanias Ministry of National Defence Statistics\nhttps://www.facebook.com/MDAarmy/posts/1360500206259425\n# Reporting: \n### Romanian State Public Broadcaster tvrinfo\n`Russian Geran-2 drone shot down by a Spanish F-18 near Galati.`\nhttps://tvrinfo.ro/drona-ruseasca-de-tip-geran-2-doborata-de-un-f-18-spaniol-langa-galati-aparatul-a-intrat-in-romania-dinspre-republica-moldova-imagini-de-la-comandamentul-aerian-al-nato/\n### Romanian News Agency news.ro & Romanias Ministry of National Defence\n`MApN statistics: In 39 cases, including August 16, penetrations of Russian drones into Romanian airspace were reported`\n`However, in the statistics consulted by News.ro, the drone shot down on August 16 also appears to be Russian.`\n<https://www.news.ro/social/peste-110-atacuri-distincte-drone-inregistrate-apropierea-romaniei-inceperea-razboiului-ucraina-statistica-mapn-39-cazuri-inclusiv-16-august-au-semnalate-patrunderi-unor-drone-rusesti-spatiul-aerian-1922400017002026081622638745>\n### Romanian Commercial Broadcaster digi24\n`The device, by shahed Type 136 (Geran 2)\n[...]\nthe flying object passed the country's airspace without authorization following the airstrikes of the Russian Federation in Ukraine`\n<https://www.digi24.ro/stiri/actualitate/ministerul-apararii-din-r-moldova-drona-doborata-la-galati-este-de-tip-geran-2-de-unde-venea-aparatul-fara-pilot-3908275>\n### Euronews Romania\n`The Ministry of Defense of the Republic of Moldova has reported that the drone shot down in Galati County is a Russian type HED 138`\n<https://youtu.be/9__tXV6TNsg&t=337>\n### Moldovan State Public Broadcaster moldova1\n<https://moldova1.md/p/83249/o-noua-drona-de-tip-geran-2-a-survolat-ilegal-spatiul-aerian-national-a-zburat-timp-de-18-minute-deasupra-al-r-moldova>\n### Moldova\u2019s Official State News Agency moldpres\n<https://www.moldpres.md/rom/societate/o-drona-de-tip-shahed-a-survolat-ilegal-spatiul-aerian-al-republicii-moldova>\n### Moldova's President Sandu 17 August:\nRussia, which started the war, is the only party responsible for these incidents\n<https://www.pravda.com.ua/eng/news/2026/08/17/8049048/>\n## Note:\nThis was proposed exactly 3 full days after the date of the first credible evidence. The totality of evidence clearly shows its a Russian drone. <:peace:1466478784575311968>",
