        "vote_type": "P2",
        "content": "**P2 - Yes**\n\n**TVR Info** (Romania's tax-funded public broadcaster) directly headlines it as a Russian Geran-2 drone, downed by a Spanish F-18, entering Romania from Moldova:\n<https://tvrinfo.ro/drona-ruseasca-de-tip-geran-2-doborata-de-un-f-18-spaniol-langa-galati-aparatul-a-intrat-in-romania-dinspre-republica-moldova-imagini-de-la-comandamentul-aerian-al-nato/>\n\n**Moldova's Ministry of Defence** (official government account) confirmed the drone type and full trajectory \u2014 launched from Russian-controlled Cotlovina (Reni region, Ukraine), crossed Moldovan airspace, exited toward Gala\u021bi:\n<https://www.facebook.com/MDAarmy/posts/1360500206259425>\n\n**News.ro** (independent Romanian outlet) reports that despite MApN's initial public caution, the drone appears in Romania's own official statistics as one of 39 confirmed Russian drone incursions, including August 16:\n<https://www.news.ro/social/peste-110-atacuri-distincte-drone-inregistrate-apropierea-romaniei-inceperea-razboiului-ucraina-statistica-mapn-39-cazuri-inclusiv-16-august-au-semnalate-patrunderi-unor-drone-rusesti-spatiul-aerian-1922400017002026081622638745>\n\n**International corroboration:**\n> \u2022 Euronews reported the shootdown and NATO involvement, noting Romanian officials' initial caution on public attribution pending debris analysis\n> <https://www.euronews.com/my-europe/2026/08/16/nato-fighter-jets-shoot-down-drone-over-romania-near-moldova-border>\n>\n> \u2022 Reuters/IBTimes Singapore coverage places this shootdown in the pattern of Romania's prior confirmed Russian Geran-2 incidents, including the May 29 Gala\u021bi strike that injured two people <https://www.ibtimes.sg/spanish-f-18-shoots-down-drone-romania-nato-air-patrols-face-new-test-92268>\n>\n> \u2022 Romania Insider confirms Moldova's MoD identification of the device as Shahed-138/Geran-2 and its Ukraine-origin flight path, sourced to Moldova's Defence Ministry via NewsMaker.md <https://www.romania-insider.com/fourth-drone-shot-down-romania-august-2026>\n\n**Conclusion:** Government sources, state broadcasters, and international outlets confirm the drone shot down near Gala\u021bi on August 16, 2026 was a Russian Geran-2.",
