        "vote_type": "P2",
        "content": "**P2 \u2014 Yes**\n\n> If, at the end of the third calendar day, conflicting reports remain as to the occurrence, attribution, or timing of the incident, this market will resolve based on the totality of information available from the resolution sources at that time.\n\nGeran-2 is a Russian drone. Multiple governmental and other sources state that it was Russian or apparently Russian. This market's standard is not incontrovertible, Phyronnic-doubt-withstandable proof, and the proposers responsibly waited the three-day period for evidence to accrue, even though there really aren't conflicting reports anyway. <@524122609764401174> and <@499341611789058048> provided more than enough evidence to resolve this market to Yes.",
