        "timestamp": "2026-08-13T09:55:48.492000+08:00",
        "vote_type": "P2",
        "content": "P2 YES\n\nVenezuela and Israel released a joint statement resuming formal ties. In this joint statement Venezuela and the State of Israel are the two formal parties.\n\nIf this doesnt count then what does?\n\nhttps://www.ynetnews.com/article/hynb006oimx\n\nhttps://themedialine.org/headlines/israel-venezuela-renew-official-ties-after-17-year-diplomatic-freeze/\n\nhttps://www.middleeasteye.net/news/israel-and-venezuela-restore-diplomatic-relations",
