        "vote_type": "P2",
        "content": "P2\n\nMarginal case but I've become convinced of P2. This communique signaling the establishment of consular services, while not a full return to the pre-2009 full diplomatic relations, is enough of a restoration of ties between the countries that it should count.\n\nThis market was a bit of a mess from the outset as Venezuela never formally derecognized Israel and should have been clarified.",
